            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0kpiboard].[none:hover:nk]>]]></run>
              <run italic='true'>&#10;First three rows: lower is better · the rest: higher is better · other countries' figures, for comparison only — no view of what makes any row its size.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </customized-tooltip>
          <style>
            <style-rule element='datalabel'>
              <format attr='color-mode' value='auto' />
              <format attr='font-size' value='7' />
